Sun Nov  8 15:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Surge XT 1.3.4
  * Built from upstream's self-contained surge-src release tarball
    (all submodules bundled, linked statically)
  * Standalone apps and surge-xt-cli in the main package; VST3, CLAP
    and LV2 plugins in surge-xt-vst3, surge-xt-clap and surge-xt-lv2;
    patches, wavetables and skins in noarch surge-xt-data
  * LV2 enabled (opt-in upstream) for LMMS
  * LTO disabled, -Werror dropped (SURGE_SKIP_WERROR)
  * Add lower-case surge-xt and surge-xt-effects commands, desktop
    files and icons
